@merger
# prose-audit: Grade A — Every surviving configuration receives a settlement, and political leadership is separated from legal machinery and organisational status.
title: What is Nowa Lewica?
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.merger_event_done = 1;

function n(value) {
    return Number(value) || 0;
}
function present(active, inside, strength) {
    const activeKnown = typeof active !== "undefined";
    const insideKnown = typeof inside !== "undefined";
    if (activeKnown && Number(active) === 0) {
        return false;
    }
    if (insideKnown && Number(inside) === 0) {
        return false;
    }
    return activeKnown || insideKnown || n(strength) > 0;
}

const baronsPresent = present(Q.barons_active, Q.barons_in_left, Q.barons_strength);
const springPresent = present(Q.spring_active, Q.spring_in_left, Q.spring_strength);
const razemPresent = present(Q.razem_active, Q.razem_in_left, Q.razem_strength);
const laborPresent = present(Q.labor_active, Q.labor_in_left, Q.labor_strength);
const progressivesPresent = present(
    Q.progressives_active,
    Q.progressives_in_left,
    Q.progressives_strength
);
const ppsPresent = present(Q.pps_active, Q.pps_in_left, Q.pps_strength);

Q.merger_barons_present = baronsPresent ? 1 : 0;
Q.merger_spring_present = springPresent ? 1 : 0;
Q.merger_razem_present = razemPresent ? 1 : 0;
Q.merger_labor_present = laborPresent ? 1 : 0;
Q.merger_progressives_present = progressivesPresent ? 1 : 0;
Q.merger_pps_present = ppsPresent ? 1 : 0;
Q.left_surviving_current_count =
    Q.merger_barons_present +
    Q.merger_spring_present +
    Q.merger_razem_present +
    Q.merger_labor_present +
    Q.merger_progressives_present +
    Q.merger_pps_present;

Q.left_merger_founders = baronsPresent && springPresent
    ? "both"
    : (baronsPresent
        ? "sld_only"
        : (springPresent ? "spring_only" : "neither"));

const scores = [];
if (baronsPresent) {
    scores.push({ name: "barons", score: n(Q.barons_strength) });
}
if (springPresent) {
    scores.push({ name: "spring", score: n(Q.spring_strength) });
}
if (razemPresent) {
    scores.push({ name: "razem", score: n(Q.razem_strength) });
}
if (laborPresent) {
    scores.push({ name: "labor", score: n(Q.labor_strength) });
}
if (progressivesPresent) {
    scores.push({ name: "progressives", score: n(Q.progressives_strength) });
}
if (ppsPresent) {
    scores.push({ name: "pps", score: n(Q.pps_strength) });
}
const strongestScore = scores.length
    ? Math.max.apply(null, scores.map(function(entry) { return entry.score; }))
    : 0;

Q.razem_can_lead_merger =
    razemPresent && n(Q.razem_strength) >= strongestScore ? 1 : 0;
Q.spring_can_lead_merger =
    springPresent && n(Q.spring_strength) >= strongestScore ? 1 : 0;
Q.barons_can_lead_merger =
    baronsPresent && n(Q.barons_strength) >= strongestScore ? 1 : 0;

// Reset only the settlement produced by this event. Legacy display variables are
// still populated by every outcome for compatibility with the wider scenario.
Q.nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 0;
Q.razem_merged = 0;
Q.barons_merged = 0;
Q.spring_merged = 0;
Q.left_common_party_exists = 0;
Q.left_merger_structure = "undecided";
Q.left_merger_scope = "undecided";
Q.left_legal_vehicle = "none";
Q.left_constitution = "undecided";
Q.left_machine_controller = "none";
Q.left_mandate = "none";
Q.left_dominant_current = "none";
Q.barons_org_status = baronsPresent ? "separate_party" : "outside";
Q.spring_org_status = springPresent ? "separate_party" : "outside";
Q.razem_org_status = razemPresent ? "separate_party" : "outside";
Q.pps_org_status = ppsPresent ? "internal_current" : "outside";

Q.news_headline = Q.razem_can_lead_merger
    ? "Razem challenges every surviving Left current to enter one party"
    : (Q.left_merger_founders === "both"
        ? "SLD and Wiosna negotiate the new party"
        : "The Left must build a successor from the organisations still standing");
!}
go-to: merger_full if left_merger_founders = "both"; merger_sld_only if left_merger_founders = "sld_only"; merger_spring_only if left_merger_founders = "spring_only"; merger_successor if left_merger_founders = "neither"


@merger_full
# prose-audit: Grade A — The clearest statement of the merger problem anywhere in the file: SLD brings the legal shell and the people who know where every contract is filed, Wiosna a brand that refuses to be an annex, Razem a membership that will not dissolve on someone else's agreement. Eight settlements follow from that, not from a seat count.
title: SLD, Wiosna and Razem negotiate the successor
new-page: true

= September 2020 — What is Nowa Lewica?

SLD brings the legal shell, regional offices and people who know where every
contract is filed. Wiosna brings a national brand whose organisers refuse to
be registered as an annex. Razem brings an existing party, its own programme
and a membership that will not dissolve merely because two other organisations
have agreed on a name.

The choice is larger than a merger between SLD and Wiosna. We must decide who
enters one political party, who remains a federal partner, who controls the
inherited machinery and what authority can remove the first leadership. [? if
razem_can_lead_merger: Razem is now at least as strong as every other current
and can demand leadership of a genuinely unified party.?] [? if
spring_can_lead_merger: Wiosna can plausibly claim that the successor should be
a break with the old SLD brand rather than its continuation.?]

- @merger_all
- @merger_members
- @merger_dual
- @merger_spring
- @merger_central
- @merger_assets
- @merger_convention
- @merger_no_deal


@merger_sld_only
# prose-audit: Grade B — Correctly refuses the easy move — "a repainting cannot by itself create a broader Left" — and prunes the option list honestly. One paragraph of framing where the full branch gets three.
title: SLD must decide what survives it
new-page: true

= September 2020 — A successor without Wiosna

Wiosna is no longer available to complete the historical bargain. SLD still
possesses the legal shell and most of the regional machinery, but a repainting
cannot by itself create a broader Left. Razem and the remaining currents can
enter a new party, negotiate a federation or leave SLD to rename only itself.

- @merger_all
- @merger_members
- @merger_central
- @merger_assets
- @merger_convention
- @merger_no_deal


@merger_spring_only
# prose-audit: Grade B — States Wiosna's real problem, a public brand without the legal inheritance or regional apparatus, in a single paragraph. Accurate and thin.
title: Wiosna must decide whether it is a party or a beginning
new-page: true

= September 2020 — A successor without SLD

The old SLD organisation is no longer inside the project. Wiosna has a public
brand and recognisable leadership, but it lacks the legal inheritance and
regional apparatus around which Nowa Lewica was supposed to be built. It can
lead a successor, join Razem in a new common party, accept a member-written
constitution or remain one party in a looser alliance.

- @merger_all
- @merger_members
- @merger_spring
- @merger_convention
- @merger_no_deal


@merger_successor
# prose-audit: Grade B — The founderless variant is a legitimate outcome and its narrowed choices are right, but nobody is present in the paragraph that sets it up.
title: Build a Left after both founding organisations are gone
new-page: true

= September 2020 — The successor has no founders

Neither SLD nor Wiosna remains available to own the name, the legal vehicle or
the story of the merger. The surviving currents must now decide whether Razem
leads a new party, a constituent convention creates one without an inherited
owner, or the Left continues as an electoral alliance of separate
organisations.

- @merger_all
- @merger_members
- @merger_convention
- @merger_no_deal


@merger_all
title: Merge every surviving current into a single Razem-led party
subtitle: Maximum integration; Razem receives political command while inherited machinery remains a separate problem.
view-if: merger_razem_present = 1
choose-if: razem_can_lead_merger = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Razem accepts dissolution only when it is at least as strong as every other surviving current.
on-arrival: {!
function add(name, amount) {
    Q[name] = (Number(Q[name]) || 0) + amount;
}
Q.nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 1;
Q.left_common_party_exists = 1;
Q.left_merger_structure = "unified_party";
Q.left_merger_scope = "all_surviving_currents";
Q.left_legal_vehicle = Q.merger_barons_present
    ? "sld"
    : (Q.merger_spring_present ? "spring" : "new_party");
Q.left_constitution = "single_leadership";
Q.left_machine_controller = Q.merger_barons_present
    ? "barons"
    : (Q.merger_spring_present ? "spring" : "razem");
Q.left_mandate = "constituent";
Q.left_dominant_current = "razem";
Q.merger_leader = "Razem";
Q.left_project = "Unified Razem-led Left";
Q.left_party_name = "Lewica Razem";
Q.razem_merged = 1;
Q.barons_merged = Q.merger_barons_present;
Q.spring_merged = Q.merger_spring_present;
Q.razem_org_status = "merged_current";
Q.barons_org_status = Q.merger_barons_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
Q.spring_org_status = Q.merger_spring_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
Q.pps_org_status = Q.merger_pps_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
add("party_unity", 10);
add("razem_dissent", -18);
add("razem_cooperation", 20);
add("organiser_energy", 3);
add("labor_credibility", 3);
if (Q.merger_barons_present) {
    add("barons_dissent", 12);
}
if (Q.merger_spring_present) {
    add("spring_dissent", 7);
}
if (Q.merger_progressives_present) {
    add("progressives_dissent", 2);
}
Q.razem_escalation_stage = 0;
Q.razem_grievance_memory = 0;
Q.razem_defection_readiness = 0;
Q.razem_demand_answered = 1;
Q.news_headline = "Razem leads every surviving Left current into one party";
!}

Every surviving organisation signs one statute and accepts Razem's programme
and leadership. [? if merger_barons_present: SLD contributes the legal vehicle
and regional offices, but it enters them into a party it no longer commands.?]
[? if merger_spring_present: Wiosna becomes a protected internal current rather
than a second founder with a permanent veto.?] Razem is not an affiliate of
this settlement. It is the incumbent leadership of the common party; the
coming struggle will be over whether the inherited machinery obeys it.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter


@merger_members
title: Create one party through a constituent membership convention
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources. Every participating organisation dissolves into a member-led successor.
choose-if: resources >= 2 and left_surviving_current_count >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Requires two resources and at least two surviving currents.
on-arrival: {!
function add(name, amount) {
    Q[name] = (Number(Q[name]) || 0) + amount;
}
Q.resources = (Number(Q.resources) || 0) - 2;
Q.nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 1;
Q.left_common_party_exists = 1;
Q.left_merger_structure = "unified_party";
Q.left_merger_scope = "all_surviving_currents";
Q.left_legal_vehicle = Q.merger_barons_present
    ? "sld"
    : (Q.merger_spring_present ? "spring" : "new_party");
Q.left_constitution = "member_executive";
Q.left_machine_controller = Q.merger_barons_present
    ? "barons"
    : (Q.merger_spring_present ? "spring" : "members");
Q.left_mandate = "constituent";
Q.left_dominant_current = "members";
Q.merger_leader = "Membership convention";
Q.left_project = "Member-founded unified Left";
Q.left_party_name = Q.merger_barons_present ? "Nowa Lewica" : "Lewica";
Q.razem_merged = Q.merger_razem_present;
Q.barons_merged = Q.merger_barons_present;
Q.spring_merged = Q.merger_spring_present;
Q.razem_org_status = Q.merger_razem_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
Q.barons_org_status = Q.merger_barons_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
Q.spring_org_status = Q.merger_spring_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
Q.pps_org_status = Q.merger_pps_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
add("party_unity", 9);
add("public_trust", 2);
add("progressives_dissent", -6);
add("labor_dissent", -5);
add("razem_dissent", -5);
add("barons_dissent", 8);
add("spring_dissent", 3);
add("media_capacity", 2);
Q.news_headline = "Members found a common Left without an inherited owner";
!}

Delegates do not merely negotiate coexistence between party executives. They
create a new membership, elect a common authority and make every participating
organisation one current among several. Razem, where present, is fully inside
the party rather than attached to it; SLD's legal shell may carry the registry
entry, but it does not by itself decide who governs.

- @poland_hub: Open the new chapter


