Wiosna wins the political argument that the successor must look like a new
party rather than the final form of SLD. [? if merger_barons_present: SLD's
regional apparatus enters the organisation as a powerful current, not its
constitutional owner.?] Razem remains an autonomous federal partner unless a
later congress offers terms on which it will actually merge.

