The SLD executive writes a constitution that can make decisions before lunch.
[? if merger_spring_present: Wiosna joins the legal party but loses the claim
that it is an equal founder.?] Razem is not described as a current inside this
party because it has not merged into it; it remains an electoral partner whose
future cooperation must be negotiated openly.

