We consolidate rooms, leases, equipment and solvent regional accounts before
any congress can redistribute them. The common organisation exists, but its
constitution is temporary and everybody understands who can lock the doors.
This is not yet a stable SLD victory; it is a machine with an unfinished claim
to political legitimacy.

