@rename
# prose-audit: Grade B — Correctly makes registration implement or contest the settlement already chosen, and the four dominant-current variants are distinct. It is bureaucracy without a person in it: no congress, no registrar, no member, and the outcomes describe who now controls machinery rather than who feels it.
title: A new name enters the registry
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.rename_event_done = 1;

function n(value) {
    return Number(value) || 0;
}
function present(active, inside, strength) {
    const activeKnown = typeof active !== "undefined";
    const insideKnown = typeof inside !== "undefined";
    if (activeKnown && Number(active) === 0) {
        return false;
    }
    if (insideKnown && Number(inside) === 0) {
        return false;
    }
    return activeKnown || insideKnown || n(strength) > 0;
}

// Migration for saves created before the structural variables existed.
if (!String(Q.left_merger_structure || "")) {
    if (!Number(Q.nowa_lewica_merger_agreed)) {
        Q.left_merger_structure = "separate_parties";
    } else if (String(Q.merger_leader || "") === "Constituent convention") {
        Q.left_merger_structure = "federation";
    } else if (String(Q.merger_leader || "") === "Dual chairs") {
        Q.left_merger_structure = "dual_party";
    } else {
        Q.left_merger_structure = "unified_party";
    }
}

if (typeof Q.merger_barons_present === "undefined") {
    Q.merger_barons_present = present(
        Q.barons_active,
        Q.barons_in_left,
        Q.barons_strength
    ) ? 1 : 0;
}
if (typeof Q.merger_spring_present === "undefined") {
    Q.merger_spring_present = present(
        Q.spring_active,
        Q.spring_in_left,
        Q.spring_strength
    ) ? 1 : 0;
}
if (typeof Q.merger_razem_present === "undefined") {
    Q.merger_razem_present = present(
        Q.razem_active,
        Q.razem_in_left,
        Q.razem_strength
    ) ? 1 : 0;
}
if (typeof Q.merger_pps_present === "undefined") {
    Q.merger_pps_present = present(
        Q.pps_active,
        Q.pps_in_left,
        Q.pps_strength
    ) ? 1 : 0;
}
if (typeof Q.merger_labor_present === "undefined") {
    Q.merger_labor_present = present(
        Q.labor_active,
        Q.labor_in_left,
        Q.labor_strength
    ) ? 1 : 0;
}
if (typeof Q.merger_progressives_present === "undefined") {
    Q.merger_progressives_present = present(
        Q.progressives_active,
        Q.progressives_in_left,
        Q.progressives_strength
    ) ? 1 : 0;
}
if (typeof Q.left_surviving_current_count === "undefined") {
    Q.left_surviving_current_count =
        Number(Q.merger_barons_present) +
        Number(Q.merger_spring_present) +
        Number(Q.merger_razem_present) +
        Number(Q.merger_labor_present) +
        Number(Q.merger_progressives_present) +
        Number(Q.merger_pps_present);
}

if (typeof Q.left_common_party_exists === "undefined") {
    Q.left_common_party_exists =
        Q.left_merger_structure === "unified_party" ||
        Q.left_merger_structure === "dual_party" ||
        Q.left_merger_structure === "partial_party" ? 1 : 0;
}
if (!String(Q.left_dominant_current || "")) {
    const legacyLeader = String(Q.merger_leader || "");
    Q.left_dominant_current = legacyLeader === "Razem"
        ? "razem"
        : (legacyLeader === "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"
            ? "barons"
            : (legacyLeader === "Robert Biedroń"
                ? "spring"
                : (legacyLeader === "Membership convention" ||
                   legacyLeader === "Constituent convention"
                    ? "members"
                    : "none")));
}
if (!String(Q.left_legal_vehicle || "")) {
    Q.left_legal_vehicle = Q.merger_barons_present
        ? "sld"
        : (Q.merger_spring_present ? "spring" : "new_party");
}
if (!String(Q.left_machine_controller || "")) {
    Q.left_machine_controller = Q.merger_barons_present ? "barons" : "shared";
}
if (!String(Q.left_mandate || "")) {
    Q.left_mandate = "negotiated";
}
if (!String(Q.left_constitution || "")) {
    Q.left_constitution = Q.left_merger_structure === "dual_party"
        ? "dual_chairs"
        : (Q.left_merger_structure === "federation"
            ? "federal_council"
            : "single_leadership");
}
if (!String(Q.razem_org_status || "")) {
    Q.razem_org_status = Number(Q.razem_merged)
        ? "merged_current"
        : (Q.left_merger_structure === "federation"
            ? "federal_partner"
            : (Q.merger_razem_present ? "electoral_partner" : "outside"));
}
if (!String(Q.barons_org_status || "")) {
    Q.barons_org_status = Q.merger_barons_present
        ? (Q.left_common_party_exists ? "merged_current" : "federal_partner")
        : "outside";
}
if (!String(Q.spring_org_status || "")) {
    Q.spring_org_status = Q.merger_spring_present
        ? (Q.left_common_party_exists ? "merged_current" : "federal_partner")
        : "outside";
}
if (!String(Q.pps_org_status || "")) {
    Q.pps_org_status = Q.merger_pps_present
        ? (Q.left_common_party_exists ? "merged_current" : "federal_partner")
        : "outside";
}
if (typeof Q.barons_merged === "undefined") {
    Q.barons_merged = Q.left_common_party_exists && Q.merger_barons_present ? 1 : 0;
}
if (typeof Q.spring_merged === "undefined") {
    Q.spring_merged = Q.left_common_party_exists && Q.merger_spring_present ? 1 : 0;
}

if (Q.merger_barons_present) {
    Q.barons_name = "Nowa Lewica organisation";
}
if (!String(Q.left_party_name || "")) {
    Q.left_party_name = Number(Q.razem_merged) &&
        String(Q.merger_leader || "") === "Razem"
        ? "Lewica Razem"
        : (Q.left_common_party_exists ? "Nowa Lewica" : "Lewica");
}
Q.news_headline = Q.merger_barons_present
    ? "The SLD legal vehicle registers the Nowa Lewica name"
    : "The successor Left must register a name without the old SLD vehicle";
!}
go-to: rename_federation if left_merger_structure = "federation"; rename_party if left_merger_structure != "federation" and left_common_party_exists = 1; rename_separate if left_merger_structure != "federation" and left_common_party_exists = 0


@rename_party
# prose-audit: Grade B — "A registry entry changes faster than a political culture" is the right frame, and the four dominant-current variants each say who really holds the keys. It stays at the level of vehicles and machinery; no member, officer or congress appears.
title: Register the common party
new-page: true

= March 2021 — A new name

A registry entry changes faster than a political culture. The common party
already has a settlement; registration now decides whether its legal vehicle,
membership roll and offices will obey that settlement or be used to rewrite
it. [? if left_dominant_current = "razem": Razem is the incumbent leadership of
this party. SLD and Wiosna, where present, are internal currents with inherited
machinery—not the natural owners waiting for Razem to leave.?] [? if
left_dominant_current = "barons": The SLD executive already holds political and
administrative command; registration can confirm that order or expose it to a
broader mandate.?] [? if left_dominant_current = "spring": Wiosna leads the
political project, but the legal vehicle may still be inherited from SLD.?]
[? if left_dominant_current = "members": The constituent settlement belongs to
the common membership, while inherited organisations still possess many of the
keys.?]

- @rename_settlement
- @rename_dual
- @rename_members
- @rename_drive
- @rename_machine


@rename_settlement
title: Register the constitution already agreed
subtitle: Preserve the political settlement and make the legal vehicle answer to it.
on-arrival: {!
function add(name, amount) {
    Q[name] = (Number(Q[name]) || 0) + amount;
}
Q.left_registry_settlement = 1;
Q.left_mandate = Q.left_mandate === "none" ? "registered_settlement" : Q.left_mandate;
if (Q.left_dominant_current === "razem") {
    Q.left_machine_controller = Q.merger_barons_present ? "shared" : "razem";
    Q.left_party_name = "Lewica Razem";
    Q.left_project = "Registered Razem-led unified Left";
    add("razem_dissent", -4);
    add("barons_dissent", 6);
    add("spring_dissent", 3);
} else if (Q.left_dominant_current === "barons") {
    Q.left_machine_controller = "barons";
    Q.left_party_name = "Nowa Lewica";
    Q.left_project = "Registered centralised Nowa Lewica";
    add("barons_dissent", -4);
    add("spring_dissent", 4);
    add("razem_dissent", 2);
} else if (Q.left_dominant_current === "spring") {
    Q.left_machine_controller = Q.merger_barons_present ? "shared" : "spring";
    Q.left_party_name = Q.merger_barons_present ? "Nowa Lewica" : Q.left_party_name;
    Q.left_project = "Registered Wiosna-led successor Left";
    add("spring_dissent", -4);
    add("barons_dissent", 5);
} else {
    Q.left_machine_controller = "shared";
    Q.left_project = "Registered member-founded Left";
    add("progressives_dissent", -3);
    add("labor_dissent", -3);
    add("barons_dissent", 4);
}
add("party_unity", 4);
add("public_trust", 1);
Q.news_headline = "The registry is made to follow the merger constitution";
!}

We register the offices, accounts and signatories under the authority already
created in September. [? if left_dominant_current = "razem": Razem remains in
command. The concession is administrative power-sharing while the inherited
records are transferred, not a return to outsider status.?] [? if
left_dominant_current = "spring": Wiosna keeps the political lead while the old
legal vehicle is subordinated to the common executive.?] [? if
left_dominant_current = "members": The constituent executive, rather than an
inherited party office, becomes the authority named in the new rules.?]

- @poland_hub: Continue


@rename_dual
title: Protect the SLD and Wiosna currents until congress
subtitle: Their internal secretariats survive, but they do not automatically replace the common leadership.
view-if: merger_barons_present = 1 and merger_spring_present = 1
on-arrival: {!
function add(name, amount) {
    Q[name] = (Number(Q[name]) || 0) + amount;
}
Q.left_machine_controller = "shared";
Q.left_constitution = Q.left_dominant_current === "razem"
    ? "single_leadership_protected_currents"
    : (Q.left_merger_structure === "dual_party"
        ? "dual_chairs"
        : "protected_currents");
if (Q.left_merger_structure === "dual_party") {
    Q.merger_leader = "Dual chairs";
    Q.left_dominant_current = "none";
    Q.left_project = "Nowa Lewica with protected SLD and Wiosna chairs";
} else if (Q.left_dominant_current === "razem") {
    Q.merger_leader = "Razem";
    Q.left_project = "Razem-led Left with protected SLD and Wiosna currents";
} else {
    Q.left_project = "Common Left with protected founder currents";
}
add("party_unity", 3);
add("barons_dissent", -3);
add("spring_dissent", -3);
add("razem_dissent", Q.left_dominant_current === "razem" ? 1 : 0);
Q.news_headline = Q.left_dominant_current === "razem"
    ? "Razem protects the defeated currents without surrendering the chair"
    : "Protected SLD and Wiosna structures carry the party to congress";
!}

Two internal secretariats keep their mailing lists, branch coordinators and
appeal rights until congress. [? if left_dominant_current = "razem": Razem
remains the party leadership. SLD and Wiosna receive protected places inside
its constitution, not a presumption that they own the party between them.?]
[? if left_merger_structure = "dual_party": The two protected chairs continue
to share authority until members settle the succession.?]

- @poland_hub: Continue


@rename_members
title: Put the existing constitution to a membership ballot
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Ratification strengthens the mandate without automatically changing the leader.
