title: A rename without a merger
new-page: true

= March 2021 — Separate parties, separate authority

There is no common political party for the registry to transform. [? if
merger_barons_present: SLD can still rename its own legal organisation Nowa
Lewica, but doing so will not absorb Wiosna, Razem or the other electoral
partners.?] [? if not merger_barons_present: Without the SLD legal vehicle,
there is no historical rename to perform. The surviving alliance can reopen
federal talks or simply keep its existing names.?]

