title: No internal merger revolt
new-page: true
on-arrival: left_revolt_event_done = 1; merger_revolt_leader = "No merger"; merger_resolution = "Separate parties, no internal revolt"; news_headline = "Separate parties negotiate rather than revolt inside one organisation"

There is no common party leadership to overthrow. Disputes may still break the
parliamentary agreement, but they are negotiations or defections between legal
organisations rather than a constitutional revolt inside one of them.

