@left_revolt_stable
# prose-audit: Grade B — The no-split outcome is well observed — "full of people discovering that other currents can count" — and each dominant-current variant says what surviving actually means. It is a one-paragraph bulletin with no decision.
title: The merger survives its first congress
new-page: true
