@federation_enforce
title: Enforce the federal compact exactly as written
on-arrival: merger_resolution = "Federal compact enforced"; left_constitution = "federal_council"; left_machine_controller = "separate"; left_mandate = "federal_arbitration"; party_unity += 5; barons_dissent -= 2; spring_dissent -= 2; razem_dissent -= 3; progressives_dissent -= 2; labor_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "Federal arbitration keeps the Left parties together"

The council allocates lists and money under the written formula and sends each
party back to its own internal organs. Nobody wins ownership of the whole Left,
but nobody can ignore the rules merely because it owns more office keys.

